{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 18, "data": [{"docid2": 2206256, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/t20260511_2206256.htm", "content": "\n各县（市、区）物业主管部门，市物业管理行业协会：\n　　为持续提升全市物业服务规范化水平，健全物业管理长效机制，培育示范标杆物业项目与优质服务品牌，推动物业服务业高质量发展，经研究，决定按年度开展全市物", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局关于开展全市物业服务项目质量评价的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/t20260511_2206256.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.26 10:13:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局关于开展全市物业服务项目质量评价的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管规〔2026〕1号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2026-00009", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2026.03.25 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2425490, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/t20260511_2206256.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1三明市住宅小区物业服务项目质量评价标准.docx", "appdocid": 2206256, "appfile": "P020260511369876236056.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/t20260511_2206256.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202605/P020260511/P020260511369876236056.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/P020260511369876236056.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件2三明市非住宅物业服务项目质量评价标准.docx", "appdocid": 2206256, "appfile": "P020260511369876377005.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/t20260511_2206256.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202605/P020260511/P020260511369876377005.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202605/P020260511369876377005.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件3 年度业主满意度评价表.docx", "appdocid": 2206256, "appfile": "P020260511369876481263.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/z