市海绵城市设施", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局 三明市自然资源局三明市住房和城乡建设局关于印发《三明市海绵城市设施运营维护技术导则》等7本技术导则的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.26 14:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局 三明市自然资源局三明市住房和城乡建设局关于印发《三明市海绵城市设施运营维护技术导则》等7本技术导则的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管综〔2025〕78号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2025-00012", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2025.09.26 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2363041, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市规划设计导则.pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543896925488.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250926/P020250926543896925488.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/P020250926543896925488.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市建设工程材料应用技术导则 .pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543897174086.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250926/P020250926543897174086.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/P020250926543897174086.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市建设工程施工与质量验收技术导则.pdf", "appdocid": 2158577, "appfile": "P020250926543897286617.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/t20250926_2158577.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202509/P020250926/P020250926543897286617.pdf", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/zcfg_0809/202509/P020250926543897286617.pdf"}, {"appdesc": "三明市海绵城市建设绿地设计