策文件", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "content": "\n \n各县（市、区）城市管理局、住房和城乡建设局、水利局、交通运输局，各有关单位：\n　　为推进三明市海绵城市建设、指导海绵城市建设工程项目的竣工验收工作，市城市管理局、住房和城乡建设局、水利局、交通运输", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.08 11:13:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局  三明市住房和城乡建设局 三明市水利局  三明市交通运输局关于印发三明市海绵城市建设工程专项验收实施细则的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明城管规〔2024〕6号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2024-00142", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2024.12.20 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2326502, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1：海绵城市建设隐蔽工程验收记录.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414100463393.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414100463393.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414100463393.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件1：海绵城市建设隐蔽工程验收记录.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414100599989.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414100599989.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414100599989.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件2：海绵城市建设工程预验收表.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414100711980.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414100711980.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414100711980.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件3：海绵城市建设工程专项验收资料备案清单.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414100847950.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 4, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414100847950.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414100847950.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件4：海绵城市建设工程专项验收监督申请书.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414100977636.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 5, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414100977636.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414100977636.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件5：海绵城市建设工程专项验收报告.docx", "appdocid": 2092915, "appfile": "P020250108414101098949.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 6, "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/t20250108_2092915.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202501/P020250108/P020250108414101098949.docx", "_href": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/P020250108414101098949.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2084267, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202412/t20241206_2084267.htm", "content": "\n　\n各县（市、区）人民政府，三明生态工贸区管委会，三明经济开发区管委会，市直各有关单位：\n　　根据《三明市海绵城市规划建设管理条例》规定，经市政府同意，现将《三明市海绵城市建设管控指标豁免清单》印发给你", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市海绵城市建设工作领导小组办公室关于印发三明市海绵城市建设管控指标豁免清单的通知", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202412/t20241206_2084267.htm", "docreltime": "2024.12.06 16:39:00", "doctitle": "三明市海绵城市建设工作领导小组办公室关于印发三明市海绵城市建设管控指标豁免清单的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明海绵办〔2024〕2号", "idxid": "sm00122-0200-2024-00140", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2024.12.06 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市城市管理局", "recid": 2326501, "sourcename": "三明市城管局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202412/t20241206_2084267.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202412/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2064392, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件", "chnldocurl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/cxjss/202409/t20240927_2064392.htm", "content": "\n　　明建〔2024〕25号\n　　三元区住建局、城管局，市市政工程养管中心、市污水处理有限公司，各老旧小区改造参建单位：\n　　现将《三明市市区老旧小区雨污分流改造工作机制（试行）》印发给你们，请结合实际，认真抓", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/cxjss/202409/t20240927_2064392.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.05 17:01:00", "doctitle": "三明市住房和城乡建设局  三明市城市管理局关于印发《三明市区老旧小区雨污分流改造工作机制（试行）》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2326535, "sourcename": "市住房和城乡建设局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/cxjss/202409/t20240927_2064392.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://zjj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/cxjss/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2052910, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202408/t20240822_2052910.htm", "content": "\n各县（市、区）城管局、发改委、公安局、市场监管局：\n　　为加强我市共享单车行业管理，规范共享单车企业管理和服务行为，满足人民群众出行需要，维护良好的城市公共秩序和市容环境，根据《中华人民共和国道路交通", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "三明市城市管理局 三明市发展和改革委员会 三明市公安局 三明市市场监督管理局关于三明市共享单车管理的实施意见", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/csglj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/202408/t20240822_2052910.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.22 10:10:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市管理局 三明市发展和改革委员会 三明市公安局 三明市市场监督管理局关于三明市共享单车管理的实施意见", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "01", "fileno": "　明城管规〔2024〕3号", "id